" version="1.1"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line></svg></button></form><div class="user_panel_widget base_widget" id="user_panel_6666698"><a data-register_action="header" class="panel_button" data-label="log_in" href="/login">Log in</a><a data-register_action="header" class="panel_button register_button" data-label="register" href="/register">Register</a></div></div><div data-target="browse" class="header_dropdown"><a href="/games/store">Indie game store</a><a href="/games/free">Free games</a><a href="/games/fun">Fun games</a><a href="/games/tag-horror">Horror games</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tools">Game development</a><a href="/game-assets">Assets</a><a href="/comics">Comics</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/sales">Sales</a><a href="/bundles">Bundles</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/jobs">Jobs</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tags">Tags</a><a href="/game-development/engines">Game Engines</a></div></div><div class="jam_page_wrap" id="wrapper"><div class="view_jam_page view_jam_base_page page_widget base_widget view_jam_default during_voting is_over has_banner" id="view_jam_3201323"><div class="jam_banner_outer"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MTA1MzE3LnBuZw==/original/3erwFv.png" class="jam_banner full_width"/></div><div class="jam_body"><div class="jam_header_widget base_widget" id="jam_header_7653789"><div class="header_inner"><div class="header_columns"><div class="title_colum"><h1 class="jam_title_header"><a href="/jam/playgama-afk-summer-jam">Playgama AFK Summer Jam ☀️💦 $1000 Prize Pool + YouTube Playables publishing</a></h1><div class="jam_host_header">Hosted by <a href="https://playgama.itch.io">Playgama</a> · <a href="https://bsky.app/hashtag/playgamajam">#playgamajam</a></div></div><div class="stats_container"><div class="stat_box"><a href="/jam/playgama-afk-summer-jam/entries"><div class="stat_value">92</div><div class="stat_label">Entries</div></a></div></div></div><div class="header_tabs"><a data-label="tab_view_jam" class="header_tab active" href="/jam/playgama-afk-summer-jam">Overview</a><a data-label="tab_view_jam_entries" class="header_tab" href="/jam/playgama-afk-summer-jam/entries">Submissions</a><div class="tab_group"><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/playgama-afk-summer-jam/community">Community</a><span class="community_activity">9</span></div><a data-label="tab_view_jam_feed" class="header_tab" href="/jam/playgama-afk-summer-jam/feed">Submission feed</a></div></div></div><div class="submitter_outer"><div class="jam_submitter_widget base_widget during_voting is_over" id="jam_submitter_9485246"><p>This jam is now over. It ran from <span data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A" class="date_format">2026-07-10 16:00:00</span> to <span data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A" class="date_format">2026-07-31 16:00:00</span>. <a href="/jam/playgama-afk-summer-jam/entries">View 92 entries</a></p></div></div><div class="jam_content user_formatted"><p><strong><a href="https://discord.gg/WEHyfAZVxs" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener"><img title="Discord-banner" alt="Discord-banner" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MTA3ODE1LnBuZw==/original/ObsXcf.png" loading="lazy"></a><br></strong></p>
<p class="text-center"><strong>Join our Playgama for Devs <a target="_blank" href="https://discord.gg/WEHyfAZVxs" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Discord</a> for Jam updates!</strong></p>
<p>Summer is supposed to be the season of vacations, slow days, sunny weather, and finally stepping away from the usual routine.</p>
<p>People travel, students go on summer break, festivals pop up everywhere, people head to the beach, go hiking, take vacations, explore new places, or just try to enjoy a slower, lighter pace for a while.</p>
<p>But game developers are a special kind of people.
</p>
<p>Even when they leave their setup behind, their brain keeps working in game design mode. A broken air conditioner can turn into a survival system. A crowded beach can become a management sim. A summer job can become an arcade game. A heatwave can become a core mechanic. <br>That’s the main idea behind the Playgama AFK Summer Jam&nbsp;☀️</p>
<p>Take inspiration from everything summer brings: holidays, heat, travel, boredom, burnout,&nbsp;seasonal jobs, beach chaos, late-night ideas, and the unexpected moments that only happen when you step away from your everyday routine.<br>Wherever your summer begins, let your next game begin there too.</p>
<p><strong><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MTA2Nzk2LnBuZw==/original/T7WLxC.png" alt="Theme" title="Theme" loading="lazy"></strong></p>
<p>1. Heat Debt<br>Every action builds up heat, and surviving means carefully balancing risk, recovery, and the environment around you.</p>
<p>2. Overpacked<br>Pack wisely, because every item you bring changes the journey and the adventures waiting at your destination.</p>
<p>3. Waiting for Wi-Fi<br>With no internet and nowhere to rush, discover how curiosity can turn an ordinary summer day into an adventure.</p>
<p>4. Melting Point<br>The world won&#x27;t wait&mdash;objects slowly melt, transform, or disappear, forcing you to constantly adapt.</p>
<p>5. 3AM Idea<br>A sleepless night sparks strange ideas, each becoming a small playable moment inside a growing notebook.</p>
<p>6. Heat Mirage<br>The intense heat distorts reality, making it impossible to tell what&#x27;s real and what&#x27;s only a mirage.</p>
<p>7. One Last Day<br>Tomorrow everything changes, and today is your final chance to make every moment count.</p>
<p>8. Shade<br>Safety exists only in the shadows, and staying in the light comes at a growing cost.</p>
<p>9. Too Hot to Touch<br>Temperature changes the way you interact with the world, turning heat into your greatest obstacle&mdash;or your greatest tool.</p>
<p>10. Beat the Heat<br>Find creative ways to survive, avoid, or even embrace the hottest days of summer.<br><br>11.&nbsp;The Long Weekend<br>A burnout simulator where &quot;winning&quot; means doing less, not more -&nbsp;an anti-productivity idle game.<br><br>12.&nbsp;Beach Management Inc.<br>Classic tycoon/management loop but themed around towel territory wars, seagull raids, and ice cream truck jingles as an actual gameplay timer.</p><p>(You can use these themes&nbsp;as-is, remix them, or come up with something entirely your own, it&#x27;s up to you.)</p>
<figure><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MTA2ODQ2LnBuZw==/original/cwAQfZ.png" alt="Prizes" title="Prizes" loading="lazy"><br></figure>
<p>1. All jam entries are automatically eligible for a publishing deal with <a href="https://playgama.com/" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener"><span>Playgama.com</span></a>.
<br>
2. <strong>The prize will be available for withdrawal once the winners will be selected during the voting period by jury.</strong>
<br>
3. The top three games will receive cash prizes:
</p>
<p><strong>1st place – $500</strong>
<br>
<strong>2nd place – $300</strong>
<br>
<strong>3rd place – $200</strong></p>
<p>The best summer stories deserve an audience.<br>The best summer game deserves one too.<br></p>
<p>The winning game will receive a publishing opportunity on <strong>YouTube Playables&nbsp;</strong>&mdash; one of the fastest-growing platforms for web games today.&nbsp;The top three games will also be featured on <span>Playgama.com</span> and distributed across our&nbsp;<a style="" href="https://playgama.com/developers" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">partner network</a>.</p>
<figure><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MTA2ODEyLnBuZw==/original/s2VbtM.png" style="color: inherit" alt="Rules" title="Rules" loading="lazy"><span></span></figure>
<p>
1. All game engines that support exporting projects to HTML5/WEB format are allowed.<br>2. All games must be web-based (HTML5), optimized for performance, and responsive to browser scaling.<br>3. The game build size must not exceed 100 MB.<br>4. Your game must be made from scratch during the jam. Submitting previously developed projects is prohibited and will result in disqualification. Pre-made or purchased assets are allowed for art and sound.<br>5. Your game must not violate anyone&#x27;s <strong>copyright and IPs</strong>. If you use assets, you must own the suitable license to use them.<br>6. Working in teams or on multiple projects is allowed.<br>7. Games must be family-friendly. NSFW content, excessive violence, or hate content is strictly prohibited.<br>8. Ensure the game is intuitive, engaging, and aligned with the jam&#x27;s theme by providing clear objectives, dynamic gameplay, and effective player feedback.<br><strong>9. All games must include </strong><a href="https://playgama.com/developers" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener"><span><strong>Playgama Bridge SDK</strong></span></a><strong>.</strong> We consider each participant a partner and strive to efficiently publish their game across multiple web platforms to maximize monetization. To facilitate this, integrating our SDK is required.<br>10. Reasonable use of AI is permitted during game development, but you must briefly indicate on the game page what specifically the AI was used for.</p>
<figure><strong><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MTA2ODUzLnBuZw==/original/RYI8e2.png" alt="Rating" title="Rating" loading="lazy"></strong></figure>
<p>Jury will select three winners based on a set of strict judging principles. The top three games will receive prizes:
</p>
<p><strong>1st place – $500</strong>
<br>
<strong>2nd place – $300</strong>
<br>
<strong>3rd place – $200</strong>
</p>
<p>Jury will evaluate each game based on the following criteria:
</p>
<p><strong>Gameplay –</strong> overall mechanics, controls, and player experience;
<br>
<strong>Theme –</strong> how well the game fits the given theme;
<br>
<strong>Polish –</strong> smoothness, bug-free experience, and overall refinement;
<br>
<strong>Visuals and Audio –</strong> quality of graphics, animations, and sound design.
<br>
After which the games will be ranked according to the average score from these criteria. The post-jam voting period will be open until 11 of August&nbsp;<strong>at 18:00 CET</strong>.
</p>
<p><strong>What is Playgama</strong>
</p>
<p><span><a href="https://playgama.com/" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Playgama.com</a></span> is a platform for web game developers that offers a comprehensive suite of tools for distributing, monetizing, and growing browser-based games. It provides an <strong>open-source</strong> <a href="https://playgama.com/developers" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener"><span>Playgama Bridge SDK</span></a> compatible with all major game engines, enabling developers to easily distribute their games across gaming and non-gaming portals worldwide. To help maximize revenue, <a href="https://playgama.com/" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener"><span>Playgama.com</span></a> features built-in monetization tools, including ad formats and in-game purchase mechanics. Additionally, the platform offers SaaS services designed to boost player engagement, such as cloud saves, leaderboards, social features, and other tools that enhance user retention and involvement.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@playgama_games" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MTA2OTAxLnBuZw==/original/2hMgi4.png" alt="Youtube" title="Youtube" loading="lazy"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://discord.gg/WEHyfAZVxs" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MTA2OTA4LnBuZw==/original/fZ6Q0I.png" loading="lazy"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://t.me/playgama_bridge" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MTA2OTE4LnBuZw==/original/0y0D0G.png" loading="lazy"></a>&nbsp; <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/playgama/" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MTA2OTM5LnBuZw==/original/XNNbeQ.png" loading="lazy"></a>&nbsp; <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@playgama.com" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MTA2OTUzLnBuZw==/original/NwbjjS.png" loading="lazy"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://x.com/PlaygamaCom" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MTA2OTU5LnBuZw==/original/cWIcu8.png" loading="lazy"></a><br></p></div></div><div id="entries" class="grid_outer"><div class="header_row"><h2>Submissions<span class="game_count">(88)</span></h2></div><div class="jam_filter_picker"><div class="filter_item active">All submissions</div><span class="divider"> · </span><div data-filter="filter_web" class="filter_item">Browser playable (82)</div><span class="divider"> · </span><div data-filter="filter_windows" class="filter_item">Windows (10)</div><div data-filter="filter_osx" class="filter_item">macOS (4)</div><div data-filter="filter_linux" class="filter_item">Linux (4)</div><div data-filter="filter_android" class="filter_item">Android (3)</div></div><div class="jam_filter_empty"><p>No submissions match your filter</p></div><div class="game_grid_widget base_widget b